"These rules control bank matching and are organized by priority and "
"company scope. Configured tolerances widen the date window and the amount"
" range accepted by the candidate engine. With Auto-reconcile enabled, "
"importing a statement automatically applies reconciliation when there is "
"a single exact candidate within tolerances, leaving an auditable record."

