msgstr "There is no quantity pending on the receipt for the invoice."

msgid ""
"La configuración de la compañía requiere una orden de compra para la "
"conciliación."
msgstr "The company configuration requires a purchase order for reconciliation."

msgid "La factura y la recepción deben pertenecer a la misma orden de compra."
msgstr "The invoice and receipt must belong to the same purchase order."

