msgstr "The invoice and purchase order must belong to the same company."

msgid "La factura y la orden de compra deben pertenecer al mismo proveedor."
msgstr "The invoice and purchase order must belong to the same supplier."

msgid "La orden de compra debe estar aprobada para el matching 2-way."
msgstr "The purchase order must be approved for 2-way matching."

msgid "La factura y la orden de compra deben estar en la misma moneda."
msgstr "The invoice and purchase order must be in the same currency."

msgid "Matching 3-way requiere que la factura referencie una recepcion de compra."
msgstr "3-way matching requires the invoice to reference a purchase receipt."

msgid "La recepcion de compra referenciada no existe."
msgstr "The referenced purchase receipt does not exist."

msgid "La factura y la recepcion deben pertenecer a la misma compania."
